# A Fluttery Fiend (abyssea 174): a level 99 Warrior in Buburimu Peninsula by the Cavernous Maw with The Truth Beckons
# completed and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, 5 maw quests completed (A Goldstruck Gigas, To Paste a
# Peiste, Megadrile Menace, The Beast of Bastore, A Delectable Demon) and A Beaked Blusterer accepted (GMs; an accepted
# one does not count). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 61 (entranceMawOnTrigger), finished on option
# 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 6 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 62 (a Progress), finished on option 0: begun. Back to
# available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 62 again (an Event-rank 62 would alternate with the maw's
# own onTrigger: 61), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the maw: no handler: 61. A zone-in, accepted
# with no Itzpapalotl title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 63 (left open); its update on option 0 and on
# option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 5 completed: Ivory Abyssite of Guerdon); finished: Ivory
# Abyssite of Guerdon given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and Dawn of Death still held): a zone-in: nothing;
# the maw: 61.
lists BuburimuPeninsula/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BuburimuPeninsula/onEventFinish/62 BuburimuPeninsula/onEventFinish/61 BuburimuPeninsula/onZoneIn/1 BuburimuPeninsula/onEventUpdate/63 BuburimuPeninsula/onEventFinish/63
char zone=BuburimuPeninsula pos=-342.896,-24.941,52.581 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer accepted
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 61
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone6                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 62
finish                                  # option 0: begun
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend available  # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 62 again (the kind)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # accepted: no maw handler: 61
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
rezone                                  # accepted, no title: nothing
title ItzpapalotlDeclawer               # a GM
rezone open                             # the title: 63, left open
update 63 option=0                      # option 0: nothing
update 63 option=2                      # option 2: nothing
update 63 option=1                      # option 1: updateEvent(Ivory Abyssite of Guerdon)
finish                                  # Ivory Abyssite of Guerdon given; completed
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # completed: no section: 61
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
